{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Green Algae is an item that can be caught using a ",["l","工具","Fishing Pole"]," during all seasons at any freshwater location, with the exception of the ",["l","农场池塘","Farm Pond"]," on the ",["l","农场地图","Standard Farm"],". It is never caught in ",["l","蟹笼","Crab Pot"],"s."]],["p",["It is also dropped from ",["l","史莱姆（怪物）","Green Slimes"]," (10% chance), and may be produced in ",["l","史莱姆鱼","Slimejack"],", ",["l","小龙虾","Crayfish"],", ",["l","蜗牛","Snail"],", or ",["l","玉黍螺","Periwinkle"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"],"s. It can also be gifted by a ",["l","动物","pet"]," cat with max ",["l","动物","friendship"],". It can also be found in ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"],"s."]],["p",["Green Algae is displayed in the ",["l","收集品","Fish section"]," of the ",["l","收集品","collection"]," tab, and counts towards the four fishing ",["l","钓鱼","Achievements"],". However, it is otherwise not considered to be a fish, and therefore cannot be sold to ",["l","威利","Willy"]," at the ",["l","鱼店","Fish Shop"],", does not benefit from fish price bonuses, cannot be used in place of \"Any Fish\" in ",["l","烹饪","recipes"],", and cannot be put in a ",["l","鱼饵制造机","Bait Maker"],", ",["l","熏鱼机","Fish Smoker"],", or ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"],"."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人",